{"reviewId": "350344876_83LZBXsmp", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "经济繁荣时（产能上行期）： 运输公司生意好，赚了钱就不断购买新车加入车队。整个车队的平均车龄越来越低，运力（产能）和效率都在提升。\n\n经济萧条时（产能下行期）： 货源不足，公司亏损，没钱也不敢买新车。现有的卡车只能一直开，坏了就修，直到报废。整个车队的平均车龄越来越高，运力（产能）停滞甚至因车辆报废而下降，效率也因为车辆老旧而降低", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "固定资产平均使用时间的上升阶段也是产能周期的下降期", "range": "12029-12054", "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "350344876_83LZBXsmp", "userVid": 350344876, "topics": [], "createTime": 1760011745, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 350344876, "name": "ZXE", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELBIEicG6sTQTKIxOZszPh0ZicGG7piaYBibNEz078KEibyicX4sLMJryZHOpcvdCibxl1PibHkgg2uZrwXDpo8qx4sF9h5VkokZI6GVt6wiaAWeVFlVoQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "ZXE", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "认知投资", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "理性决策，人间皆为幻景", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 21, "likes": [{"userVid": 30530883, "name": "陈亚东", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTKIfq1mD64ic0deZcHQ4T1CFnyL3rdVcKicTTPE9XzqoiaorgNjDaAiaH7YgIiaLakcbUhzrh5xldpXMog/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M5-0-10", "desc": "读完书籍", "title": "读完书籍", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": 